# an exclusive aspect starts nothing in parallel: a start in it is a compile error, the limit of two starts of D-140 is gone
** spec: semantics/multitasking.md#where-a-group-is-allowed
primary aspect d26_nested_too_many is
  process main is
    new r: Integer;
    apply outer(1, @r);
  return;
end d26_nested_too_many;
